%% Activity diagram: dispatcher assigns vehicles
flowchart TD
  A([Open Event Dispatch]) --> B[Select an event]
  B --> C[Show assigned vehicles and their seats]
  C --> D[Filter available vehicles by type and location]
  D --> E[Tick vehicles and choose reassign option]
  E --> F[Press Assign]
  F --> G[For each vehicle: set Assigned only if still Available]
  G --> H[Link vehicle to event]
  H --> I[Event capacity becomes the sum of vehicle seats]
  I --> J{Free a vehicle later?}
  J -- yes --> K[Set Available, assignment Concluded]
  K --> L{Any vehicles left on the event?}
  L -- no --> M[Capacity goes back to vendor's number]
  L -- yes --> I
  J -- no --> N([Done])
